{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ba8ffa1c-f402-8c44-b40c-e3cda02fb964",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T12:03:18-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Deirdre Gallagher",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:01:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:01:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Tony, Deirdre Gallagher. Sorry, I'm on my lunch break, walking back from the parking lot, and I've already been running around since six this morning. Anyway, it's about my water bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:02:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's almost double what I normally pay. I'm at 253 Memorial Boulevard, down by Easton's Beach. Nothing's changed. No leaks that I know of, and I've been home no more than usual. Double, with no reason."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:02:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Could be an estimated read, could be a stuck meter, could be a running toilet. I'll note a request to have the meter re-read. Is the bill in your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:02:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Oh, and my daughter helps me with the bills, so I want her authorized to talk to you folks about it. Can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:02:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, we can add her as a contact on the account. She'd need to call in with her name and the account details, and we'll note it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:02:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now, City Hall hours don't work for me. Can I pay online from my desk at lunch? Or some other way outside regular hours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:02:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, there's online payment on the city website, and there's a drop box at City Hall for checks anytime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:03:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. What's the best number to reach me, you said? I'd give you my cell, it's 401-555-0198. Though my phone's been dying all day because my brother borrowed my charger and never gave it back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:03:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Classic. Got that number. Someone will call you about the re-read."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:03:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Tony. Bye."
    }
  ],
